# ── Patient-derived imagery — NEVER commit any of this ────────────────────────
# Captures written by the PHC app, and the central server's media tree plus
# Grad-CAM overlays. All of it is derived from patient fundus photographs and
# falls under the same handling rule as the raw captures.
phc-local-app/backend/uploads/
phc-local-app/backend/captures/
phc-local-app/backend/storage/
central-system/backend/media/
central-system/backend/explainability-outputs/

